"A procedure type's specification, `(requires P)` and `(ensures r Q)`
 after its result, its parameters named: FX-26's (Fixpt's `specs.rs`),
 which kayak's checker has for the engine (C162) and KFX has not yet."
(define clamp (subr pure ((lo int) (hi int) (x int)) int
                (requires (<= lo hi)) (ensures r (and (<= lo r) (<= r hi))))
  (lambda (lo hi x) (if (< x lo) lo (if (< hi x) hi x))))
(define main (subr (read (globals clamp)) () int) (lambda () (clamp 0 10 20)))
